terms.sec2_2_p:
To use the Services you must register. You agree to:
• Provide accurate, current and complete information;
• Keep your information up to date;
• Create only one account for personal use and not share it;
• Ensure all activity is authentic;
• Allow suspension if you breach the Terms.

privacy.sec3_p:
We process your data to:
• {b_open}Provide the Services{b_close} (contract, Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR): create account, track activity, generate AI plans;
• {b_open}Improve the Services{b_close} (legitimate interest, Art. 6(1)(f)): aggregated analytics, fraud prevention;
• {b_open}Communications{b_close} (consent, Art. 6(1)(a)): newsletter, promotional notifications (revocable);
• {b_open}Legal obligations{b_close} (Art. 6(1)(c)): billing, AML;
• {b_open}Social features{b_close} (consent): route sharing, friendships.

privacy.sec4_p:
We do NOT sell your data. We share with:
• {b_open}Service providers{b_close}: AWS/MongoDB Atlas (EU hosting), Anthropic (AI Coach), Stripe/Apple/Google (payments), SendGrid (email);
• {b_open}Other users{b_close}: only data you choose to make public (name, photo, shared activities);
• {b_open}Authorities{b_close}: only if required by law or court order.
Data stays in EU/EEA where possible. Extra-EU transfers only with EU-approved Standard Contractual Clauses (SCC).

privacy.sec5_p:
We retain your data for the time needed for the purposes:
• Active account data: for the entire account duration;
• Activity data: indefinitely unless deleted at your request;
• Technical logs: 12 months;
• Billing data: 10 years (tax obligation);
• Inactive accounts >24 months: anonymized or deleted.

privacy.sec6_p:
Under GDPR you have the right to:
• {b_open}Access{b_close} (Art. 15): get a copy of your data;
• {b_open}Rectification{b_close} (Art. 16): correct inaccurate data;
• {b_open}Erasure{b_close} (Art. 17, "right to be forgotten"): request deletion;
• {b_open}Restriction{b_close} (Art. 18): limit processing;
• {b_open}Portability{b_close} (Art. 20): receive your data in structured format (JSON);
• {b_open}Objection{b_close} (Art. 21): object to processing on legitimate interest;
• {b_open}Withdraw consent{b_close} (Art. 7(3)) anytime.
You can exercise these rights directly from the app ({b_open}Profile > Account & Privacy{b_close}) or by writing to support@apprunhub.com. Response within 30 days. You also have the right to complain to the {b_open}Italian Data Protection Authority{b_close} (garanteprivacy.it).

privacy.sec7_p:
We adopt appropriate technical and organizational measures:
• TLS 1.3 encryption in transit;
• Bcrypt password hashing;
• Database hosting in EU with restricted access;
• Automatic encrypted backups;
• Periodic security audits;
• Suspicious access monitoring.
In case of a data breach, we will notify you within 72 hours as required by GDPR.
